      "message": "test(post): Tormach probe goldens take main's protected positioning moves\n\nAfter merging main (#174, 453142b4) the probe cycle's positioning feeds\npost as G38.3 + `o5001.. if [#5070 EQ 1]` / M2 guard blocks; the Tormach\nprobe goldens are regenerated for exactly that (every removed\n`G1 X Y Z F` is replaced by a G38.3 to the same point and its guard).\nmain's probe_guard_moves.nc loses its `S0 M3`: this PR's touch probe\n(0 rpm) starts no spindle. The corner test counts the tolerance\nmessages by their own text, since the guard's message also starts\n\"(MSG, PROBE \". The decision record notes the two O-word ranges.\n\nRefs #362\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
