      },
      "message": "feat(post): the probe report names its unit\n\nThe Tormach PathPilot probe report now ends with the program's unit:\n(DEBUG, PROBE <axis> ERROR #19n MM) in a G21 program and ... IN) in a\nG20 one, from the same `inch` flag that writes G20/G21 - asked for after\nthe real 770MX run, where an inch deviation read like a mm value. The\nTormach probe goldens change only in that word; probe_report pins IN on\nthe inch 770MX and MM on a metric (no machine file) program.\n\nRefs #575\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
